Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,either will I'm feeling alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves!.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.46,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling alive!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up sunshine, here we go!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.52,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very first\Nday, I'd make my name!.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine!.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.78,0:02:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.24,0:02:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.38,0:02:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that stripey fellow go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.34,0:02:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I've completely lost sight of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.22,0:02:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll be dead long\Nbefore you can notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Amoplage carpet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did it sound like\Nthe ground was talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a good aim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You've fallen into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Little did you know that was my\Nweapon-destroying technique, body sword crush.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the tip of your sword has crumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.48,0:03:30.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's worthless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.18,0:03:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I stabbed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.60,0:03:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He really thinks he can play it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arrogance will only lead to\Nyour Davy - uh, lead to your defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.54,0:03:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost him again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.98,0:03:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How does he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.84,0:03:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hidden flail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,66 now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.32,0:04:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned something\Nin these past two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to an understanding about the\Ntrue nature of the revive, revive fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,When most people die,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,their body is left behind while their\Nsoul continues on to the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But my soul is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.00,0:04:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,In accordance with the power of my devil\Nfruit, it has been tempered like iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.62,0:04:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Radiating with strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it maintains its hold in this realm\Nwith a presence that is palpable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That soul resonates through\Nthe strings of my instruments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock and roll, screaming\Nfrom another dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.30,0:05:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmerized by its melodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.66,0:05:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The listeners dance their\Nway into a land of illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.14,0:05:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But when my soul flutters\Naway from this old body?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It is no mere apparition!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It can be seen as surely\Nas my rattling bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.80,0:05:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,POPPED HIS HEAD RIGHT OFF HIS BODY NECK!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I KILLED A Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.08,0:05:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M FINE.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.36,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can chop me up as much as you'd like,.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,for it is neither flesh nor\Norgans that bind me to this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.38,0:05:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what is it that gives\Nme life, you might ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.32,0:05:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my soooooom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed him so hard it\Nbrought him back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it starting to sink in yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But none of your attacks can\Ndamage these bones and mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.06,0:06:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead and you're\Nnot going to kill me twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.08,0:06:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, this blade I wield\Nis like none other,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,sharpened by the Long-Armed tribe\Nand granted up a fitting name.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.78,0:06:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul Solid, engrave that\Ntitle upon your heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.46,0:06:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,With a single soulful slash,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.36,0:06:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll freeze you with the frigid air\Ncreeping from the land of the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.22,0:07:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,As its icy grip claims you,\Ngaze upon its bitter blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice, Brook!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I'd better step it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.74,0:07:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole crew's looking good,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,showing off those skills they\Nlearned for the new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.66,0:07:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's real sweet to hear how highly\Nyou think of all your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't you worry,\Nsince I'm such a nice guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to drown\Nall of you together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.50,0:07:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.58,0:07:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireball cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.82,0:07:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bouncing faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.34,0:07:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's safe to say I found\Nthe weak link in the Straw Hat crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.64,0:08:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All those shots and you couldn't\Neven hit me a single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.96,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Might want to stay put, mole shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.46,0:08:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a cookie cutter shark, jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.76,0:08:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoy the trap I set for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lie down and give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop the Noah now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.46,0:08:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll watch every one\Nof your friends perish?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.30,0:08:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.66,0:08:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm putting you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Illusions of grandeur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.72,0:08:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.58,0:08:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Second gear! Armament!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.22,0:08:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, fight your arm off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.64,0:08:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Hawk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.98,0:09:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Moshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake me, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.36,0:09:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get to the Noah! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.54,0:09:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead! Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I refuse to run! Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.36,0:09:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Noah's right above us! I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.26,0:09:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But this reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes me think of another\Npirate who fought to protect us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.74,0:09:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened when I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Twenty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.40,0:09:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I even recall you being\Nthere. You remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one other human\Nour kingdom revered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.02,0:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell of a hole we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.46,0:10:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You in the mood to die or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.22,0:10:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.98,0:10:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is he siding with the fishmen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune helped me out of a jam\None time back when we were young,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.18,0:10:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and we pledged friendship\Nover cups of sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't kill me! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.64,0:10:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never kidnap\Nmermaids or fish men again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:50.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to mess with my friend's country,\Nthen you face the consequences. You snot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You listen up. This island\Nis under my protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about\NWhitebeard. That guy was a
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.66,0:11:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,living legend you trust\Nthe Straw Hats that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.76,0:11:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong. I\Ndon't even like humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.54,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,honestly and this is\Nour kingdom not theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But they our minds were made up as soon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as we got to the plaza with jimbe's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We were gonna save this island\Nleave it to me and my crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.76,0:11:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what friends are\Nfor. Right, the things that
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,straw had said and they're\Nrisking their lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.78,0:12:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.00,0:12:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I can breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.20,0:12:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's this tough, his\Nbounty would be high!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans can be so\Narrogant it amazes me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.98,0:12:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're more likely to get yourselves\Nkilled than admit how weak you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.02,0:13:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll have to beat\Nsome humility into you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.26,0:13:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm kind of in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.62,0:13:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We've finished this up already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.76,0:13:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think you can, be my cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Weepy Hachi, get out of here! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.68,0:13:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This time, Jiu-Jitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Water Hut!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.86,0:13:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut that mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.86,0:13:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I messed it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.46,0:13:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Third gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.48,0:13:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.39,0:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.24,0:14:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How much does it take?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Insolent fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.46,0:14:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.38,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.48,0:14:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They've forsaken their\Nbrightest fish, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.18,0:14:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They deserve to pay the price.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.02,0:15:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.30,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.00,0:15:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, beat him! Finally!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.64,0:15:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone on the island is doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.56,0:15:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.74,0:15:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Zeal?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.40,0:15:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The island's gonna get crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.04,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.46,0:15:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the power our captain has.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He was chosen by heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,He could never be beaten by\Nsome measly, pathetic human!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But, I mean, we're not getting nothing\Nif the Noah destroys this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.62,0:16:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Death is only another form of revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.62,0:16:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And we will die for our hatred of\Nhumans. Our flesh and blood will be
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,remembered as a tragedy and the grudge\Nagainst humans will grow ever stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We may fall, but thousands more will\Nstand up to take revenge in our name!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goody?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.92,0:16:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all insane. Not just Captain\NHeart, but all of you officers too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.42,0:16:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Blame the humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones who made us this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.32,0:16:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.78,0:16:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Take that rage of yours and let\Nit loose on all of humanity!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.40,0:16:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They deserve your hate. Look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.42,0:17:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what they've done to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.26,0:17:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the ones behind every\Ndisaster the fish had up met!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is all that stuff you're saying true?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are humans really that bad? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, that's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,humans have done plenty of awful things,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,especially when you look\Nat their history with...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Charlie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see what's happening\Nwith your own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.28,0:17:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look, on the ground, and in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The humans are fighting against\Nthe new fishman pirates, for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.36,0:17:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What about that guy? Is\Nhe human? Their crew is
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,a bit strange but the\Nimportant thing is what
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing. You must\Nsee things for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,that's the only way to\Nunderstand the truth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.58,0:18:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what you've heard in the past you\Nmust look at today with an objective eye
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you refuse to fight to the death\Nand try to run, I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hatred of humans won't be waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They're your own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.04,0:18:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you treat them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.12,0:18:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.26,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Skeleton Mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.82,0:18:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.12,0:18:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never died, so don't talk\Nlike you know anything about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tied to leave your hate behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.06,0:18:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.64,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left when you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.76,0:18:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The only things left\Nbehind are your bones!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.30,0:18:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy knows what he's talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.70,0:18:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.61,0:18:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's one kind of\Nperson I don't like,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.00,0:18:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,it's someone who doesn't\Nvalue the lives of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even stand their smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't have a nose to smell them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.20,0:19:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You and your friends are the ones\Nwho don't value the lives of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.62,0:19:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you all think you're being bold\Nand selfish by staying here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But every last one of you humans are\Ngonna die when the Noah hits the island!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.96,0:19:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I'm still not sure\Nwhether you're human or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can promise you that\None of these days our
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Luffy will become\Nthe king of the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.58,0:19:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a man who keeps his\Nword no matter the cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.00,0:19:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So if he says that no harm will come to\Nthe people here, then no harm will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe in him no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:19:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,so that ship will never touch this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.80,0:19:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's time for me\Nto step up and do my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:48.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I won't let you\Ndisappear before my eyes again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.70,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,even though I have no eyes to speak of!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.44,0:19:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.56,0:20:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressed yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.62,0:20:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, that's pretty damn big.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.86,0:20:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, impressive stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.56,0:20:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.70,0:20:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, do you want to\Nwrap this up now, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.52,0:20:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's about time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You've destroyed both of my swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I win a sword\Nfight if I don't have swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.94,0:20:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going balls out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.68,0:20:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This new special move is going to\Ntake you down in a single shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, and on the third step,\Nit's all over. Think I'm kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.66,0:20:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.62,0:21:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of moron do you take me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm calling you out on your stupid bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.90,0:21:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a weakling and\Nyou'll always be a weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.24,0:21:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I used to lie about\Nthis kind of stuff all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.02,0:21:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But now it doesn't really\Nmatter if you believe me or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I know I'm the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.00,0:21:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.98,0:21:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that thing come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.92,0:21:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That runt?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.26,0:21:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd he get so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.84,0:21:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, pal! Easy! Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.02,0:21:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't lose control like before!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.64,0:21:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper, are you sure\Nyou're okay over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.50,0:22:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I got it all under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.36,0:22:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With just one rumble ball, I can\Nfight in this form for three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.22,0:22:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I don't pass out at the\Nend or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.04,0:22:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you guys don't have to\Nlook out for me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.60,0:22:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sell yourself short if\Nyou can do this kind of stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever you want you're gonna\Nbe the one looking out for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.92,0:22:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Flattery will get you nowhere, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.72,0:22:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't work on me. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.50,0:22:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, not at all
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.96,0:22:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you've really made me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.04,0:22:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care how big you are\Nall it takes is one good docent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.54,0:22:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.10,0:22:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Dosing all you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.96,0:23:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I don't plan on going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.84,0:23:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.20,0:23:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice going.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.74,0:23:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.65,0:23:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can just chat it up with\Nyour friend in the middle of a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.84,0:23:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky I don't gnaw\Nstraight through you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.64,0:23:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why your Straw Hat pals bother\Nputting up with dead weight like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.62,0:23:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do my favor and\Nput you out of your misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.74,0:23:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to try, but first\NI want to show you something cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.90,0:23:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Pay attention you're about to see\Na magic trick you'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.62,0:23:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A special move if that's your game,\NI've got plenty of those myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.80,0:23:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the squid spear didn't\Nwork, but I've got another.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.44,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,weapon that'll Don't cut through\Nanything you can throw at me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Say hello to the Lightbrite spear!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's powerful enough to cut\Na hole through your cockpit!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.80,0:24:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This battle will be over in one\Nshot, but it'll be won by me, hee!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.92,0:24:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That does look pretty sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.36,0:24:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I'm being honest, it's still way\Nless ultimate than my ultimate weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.84,0:24:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're squid out of luck now, dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.10,0:24:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a swordman without his swords?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.78,0:24:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.84,0:24:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just going to croak\Nlike a frog. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.10,0:24:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrap this up, you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.18,0:24:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Not till I'm good and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.48,0:24:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I got all puffed up just\Nto deal with a loser like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.38,0:24:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.26,0:24:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know all I got to do is\Nroll around this plaza a few
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.32,0:24:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,times and all your friends will\Nbe smooshed flat as pancakes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.20,0:24:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my space. You washed up\Npile of bones. Take one step.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.04,0:24:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,inside this circle and you'll\Nbe dead all over again I promise
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.22,0:25:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm terribly sorry, but I've already made\Nmy way inside the circle and cut you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.44,0:25:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, as a fair warning,\Nthis will be cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.20,0:25:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.38,0:25:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Song of Scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.38,0:25:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Blizzard Slice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.42,0:25:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, a haiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.32,0:25:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,A blood-chilling wind howls\Nfrom the land of the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.24,0:25:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.80,0:25:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.14,0:25:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My queen star, human drake technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.54,0:26:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Those plants have arms\Nand leg-shaped roots that
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,attack and latch onto\Nwhatever flies over them!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.56,0:26:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.38,0:26:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.24,0:26:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Green Star Trampolia.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.36,0:26:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty self-explanatory. Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.06,0:26:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,now that you've been\Ncatapulted into the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.34,0:26:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,there's not much you can\Ndo to defend yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.66,0:26:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes Green Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.44,0:26:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about you, dumb dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.66,0:26:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll rip it to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.74,0:26:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.06,0:26:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,See that red bulb on its nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.38,0:26:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If you attack, that thing will release a\Ndevastating shockwave three meters wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.90,0:26:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.65,0:26:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dosan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.28,0:26:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Glamsan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.64,0:26:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Slamsan!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.90,0:27:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Better watch out or you'll get hit by\Nthe dosanest dosan that ever dosered!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.58,0:27:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Popper a hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.44,0:27:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.16,0:27:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rogue'some.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.74,0:27:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Eka, eka, eka!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.74,0:27:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't make dried squid out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Eka, eka, eka!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.42,0:27:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Radical me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.62,0:27:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's got a laser beam too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.70,0:28:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.61,0:28:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he just bring a leak?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.52,0:28:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All these ears are going to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.92,0:28:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.46,0:28:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your last.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.06,0:28:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you know how to fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You scared the guts out of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.52,0:28:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The last two years were\Na stain upon my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.30,0:28:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.16,0:28:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I went through hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.18,0:28:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.68,0:28:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He got my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.30,0:28:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to burn those days to ashes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.78,0:28:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared the guts out of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.50,0:28:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, that'll make the job easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Blowfish guts are toxic.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.74,0:28:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to take that part out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.38,0:28:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see you block this!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit it, Frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.74,0:28:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.84,0:29:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I'm not a frog!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.92,0:29:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Master Swordsman Yasuie,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.52,0:29:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishman Islands Champion of\Nthe Octopus Eight-Sword Style!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.84,0:29:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Curgatory!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.24,0:29:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,PUNIGINI!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.66,0:29:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.98,0:29:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're not a frog after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.62,0:29:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But you did broke.
